Rym: Most of the game is not under any time pressure.

629
00:48:33,712 --> 00:48:36,420
Rym: It's just a matter of execute or understand.

630
00:48:36,982 --> 00:48:40,580
Rym: There are a small number of puzzles that have a very slight time pressure.

